cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KOVA3, please cite the resource and state the release version used."
title: "Korean Variant Archive 3 (KOVA3)"
abstract: >-
  KOVA3 is an openly licensed, population-level allele-frequency resource for the
  Korean population, published as an aggregate sites-only layer (allele counts,
  allele numbers, allele frequencies, homozygote counts, call rates, filters, and
  callability) derived from a uniformly joint-genotyped whole-genome callset.
